VARIABLES
p1 >= 0 <= 400
p2 >= 0 <= 100
p3 >= 0 <= 150
p4 >= 0 <= 500

CONSTRAINTS
5p1 + 3p2 + 4p3 + 4p4 <= 3600
10p1 + 6p2 + 5p3 + 2p4 <= 3600
6p1 + 4p2 + 3p3 + 1p4 <= 3600

OBJECTIVE
max
5p1 + 6p2 + 5p3 + 4p4 - (5/60 * 2 * p1 + 10/60 * 2 * p1 + 6/60 * 3 * p1) - (3/60 * 2 * p2 + 6/60 * 2 * p2 + 4/60 * 3 * p2) - (4/60 * 2 * p3 + )

PRINTS
p1
p2
p3
p4

END
